@page "/"
<PageTitle>Tangent Atlas</PageTitle>

@* The home page is the first section only; the menu leads to a page for each of the others. *@
<section class="ta-hero">
    <div class="ta-container ta-hero-inner">
        <div class="ta-hero-head">
            <h1 class="ta-hero-title">A thermostat for <em>all</em> your money.</h1>
            <p class="ta-hero-subtitle">Paychecks, bonuses, checking, savings, credit cards, retirement, investments. Set the temperature, and Tangent Atlas keeps your money from running too hot or too cold.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ta-hero-grid">
            <div class="ta-hero-copy">
                <p class="ta-hero-lead">Connect your online accounts and see everything you own and owe on one dashboard. Measure your portfolio the way professionals do, by risk as well as return. Then build your own personal index, without the companies you’d rather not own, using the same published methods as the big index funds.</p>
                <p class="ta-hero-lead">Your house, your rules. Your rules decide where every dollar goes, coming in or going out. Your risk setting decides what you invest in: how many companies, and how much cash. Like a thermostat, your personal index holds that setting, buying and selling to keep it where you put it. When your life changes, just adjust the dial.</p>
                <p class="ta-hero-lead">A plan that only works when the sun is shining is half a plan. What happens when you lose your job, when your company goes belly up, when you get a margin call? You need cash, and you want to raise it as carefully as you built your portfolio. What do you sell first? What do you sell last? Make raising cash part of your plan.</p>
            </div>

            <RulesPanel />
        </div>

        <div class="ta-page-final ta-home-final">
            <p class="ta-page-close">Keep your bank, your broker and your stocks.</p>
            <AuthorizeView>
                <NotAuthorized>
                    <a href="/signup" class="ta-btn ta-btn-primary ta-btn-large">Sign up</a>
                </NotAuthorized>
            </AuthorizeView>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
